  "description": "FluentStorage, originally known as Storage.NET, is a polycloud .NET cloud storage library to interface with multiple cloud providers from a single unified interface. Provides Blob storage (AWS S3, GCP, FTP, SFTP, Azure Blob/File/Event Hub/Data Lake) and Messaging (AWS SQS, Azure Queue/ServiceBus). Supports .NET 5+ and .NET Standard 2.0+. Pure C#. MIT license. Commercial use allowed.",
